# DEV Mapbox token (pk.…) for local runs only. Allow http://127.0.0.1:8731 on it in your Mapbox account.
# The live site uses a separate PROD token stored only as the GitHub secret MAPBOX_TOKEN.
# Update prod with `gh secret set MAPBOX_TOKEN` (it prompts). Never `gh secret set -f .env`: that copies dev to prod.
MAPBOX_TOKEN=
